  "details": "With the new camera in the open beta, when you project a certain object in a certain world, the video will have an effect like a VR perspective and certain objects will become invisible. (See attached image)\nMy other friends in the open beta were experiencing the same thing.\nThis has never happened with any of the older cameras I've used.\nThe ID of the world where the problem occurs: wrld_a4ef4165-681c-4f3b-a293-839aebcbc434 [Olympia Nights （v 1․0）by DrMorro]",
